-| Code block body | default `14px` |
-| Code block header | `text-ui-base` |
-| Tables | `text-ui-base` |
+| Surface                               | Standard                              |
+| ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |
+| User and assistant message containers | `text-ui-lg`                          |
+| Markdown body                         | `text-ui-base`                        |
+| h1                                    | `text-ui-xl` (`--ui-font-size + 4px`) |
